### 0. Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/health

### 1. Login System Administrator (Save token variable)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@nasfam.mw",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Store token from login response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2. Get Authenticated User Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Get System Roles (Get Role ID for User Creation)
# @name roles
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

@warehouseRoleId = {{roles.response.body.data[1].id}}

### 4. Create New User Account (Triggers Automated Credentials Email Dispatch!)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Isaac Officer",
  "email": "warehouse.officer@nasfam.mw",
  "phone": "+265 999 111 222",
  "password": "Officer@Pass2026",
  "roleId": "{{warehouseRoleId}}",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 5. Get Farmers List (Paginated)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/farmers?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Create New Farmer Record
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/farmers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Chikondi",
  "lastName": "Banda",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "phoneNumber": "+265 991 234 567",
  "district": "Lilongwe",
  "village": "Mphande 1",
  "farmSize": 2.5,
  "primaryCrops": ["Maize", "Groundnuts"],
  "seedLoanBalance": 2500
}

### 7. Get Master Commodities
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/master-data/commodities
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Get Purchases List
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Trace Grain Lineage (Search by Receipt Number)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/traceability/trace?code=RCP-2026-0001
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Push Mobile Offline Batch Data Sync
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/sync/push
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "deviceId": "mobile-dev-001",
  "farmers": [],
  "farms": [],
  "purchases": []
}

### 11. Get System Summary Analytics Report
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/reports/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
